  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECES, Jun 2021, support&apos;g elect&apos;n/Eth. Democracy Europ&apos;n Centre/Electoral Sup&apos;t</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Observation of the June 2021 Ethiopian national elections  implemented by the European Centre for Electoral Support, aims to ensure observation by independent CSOs of the national elections. The objective is to contribute towards prevention, mitigation and management of election-related conflicts and violence throughout the electoral process. Key activities include civic and voter education, support to local peacemakers, observation of the entire election process and the capturing of key lessons to further strengthen the electoral system.</narrative>
  </description>
